{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10283110","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10283110","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1028311001:1":{"text":"“싱싱한 마력 새싹”은 이블 시드에서만 채집할 수 있다고요... 음, 이블플라워는 아는데, 이블 시드는 한 번도 본 적이 없어요.","source_cn":"“新鲜的魔力嫩芽”只能在魔花种子上采集到……呃，魔花我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDFD4CBB00A7EA93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028311002:1":{"text":"『야생 생물 도감』에도 없었는데...","source_cn":"《野外生物图鉴》里也没提到过啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC14C165FC12986A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028311003:1":{"text":"아마 본 적 있을걸요? 숲 속에서 여기저기 뛰어다니는 꼬맹이들인데, 부끄럼이 많아서 작은 소리에도 “슉”하고 도망가 버려요!","source_cn":"你们或许见过？丛林里那些蹦蹦跳跳的害羞小家伙，只要有一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AEF8A37E1208F78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028311004:1":{"text":"속도가 엄청 빨라서, 마력 새싹 채집은 엄두도 못 내요.","source_cn":"以那些小家伙的灵敏，谁也别想直接从它们身上采摘魔力嫩芽。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F02EB304ED11EFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028311005:1":{"text":"부끄럼이 많고 쉽게 도망가서 채집이 어렵다... 방법을 찾아봐야겠네요...","source_cn":"害羞、容易逃跑、无法采摘，得想个办法……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3CC14B2A1E1343B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028311006:1":{"text":"우리랑 거래하자고 한 번 물어보는 건 어때요?","source_cn":"也许可以试着问问它们，愿不愿意跟我们做个交易？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D1838B1C4C4E477","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1028311007:1":{"text":"거래요? 미샤르테께서 강림하지 않는 이상, 이블 시드들은 절대 우리의 언어를 이해하지 못할 거예요. 손짓 몸짓도요.","source_cn":"交易？除非弥萨忒显灵，否则它们绝对无法理解我们的语言，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8AEE6F82CDA3CF4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028311008:1":{"text":"아쉽네요. 다른 생물들과 소통하는 게 제 주특기인데. 고블린하고도 통했고, 골렘들 하고도...","source_cn":"真可惜，我可是很擅长和其他的生物交流沟通的，比如咕布林...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5856F2DD41D08F55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028311009:2":{"text":"음? 고블린... 좋은 생각이 났어요! 이블 시드를 포획하면 되잖아요!","source_cn":"咦，说起咕布林……我想到了！我们可以捕捉一只魔花种子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE231AD070CE98F5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1028311010:1":{"text":"포획? 너 설마...","source_cn":"捕捉？难道你想……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C38B82420C86822","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028311011:1":{"text":"그래, 함정을 쓰면 돼! 간단하고 제일 효과적인 방법이지. 지금 상황에 딱 맞아.","source_cn":"没错，用陷阱！简单又有效的方案，正适合现在这种情况。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1CE6919618F6660","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028311012:1":{"text":"함정을 설치할 장소도 있어. 거기보다 좋은 곳은 없을걸?","source_cn":"我已经想到了布置陷阱的地方，再没有比那里更合适的了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF454292A710C007","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1028311013:1":{"text":"시간 아까우니까 따로 행동하자!","source_cn":"事不宜迟，咱们分头行动！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED268A401BF3F81E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1028311014:0":{"text":"갈리, 기다려 봐!","source_cn":"伽利，等等！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94F323B984B3834A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伽利":{"text":"갈리","source":"伽利","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:梅丽莎":{"text":"멜리사","source":"梅丽莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":3}}